# ============================================================================
# Production build settings (read automatically by `vite build`)
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The API is served by the same Node process as the frontend, so a relative
# base URL keeps everything same-origin and avoids CORS entirely. If you put a
# reverse proxy in front and mount the API elsewhere, change this to that path
# (for example https://pos.example.com/api).
# ============================================================================
VITE_API_BASE_URL=/api
